//! The `animation-range-end` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! the point on the timeline where an animation should end.
//!
//! Initial: normal. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: Relative to the specified named timeline range if specified, otherwise relative to
//! the entire timeline.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - normal: Represents the end of the timeline. This is the default value.
